== Reference for Evaluating Gauge RR Dataset
There are manay reference materials but almost papers suggests very simple cases. References written below have the detail information and procedures for evaluating Gauge RR dataset. 

- *Montgomery(2009)* Design and Analysis of Experiment. 7th. Wiley, New York
- *Montgomery (1993a)* Gauge Capability and Designed Experiment: Part I: Basic Methods. Quality Engineering. p115-135
- *Montgomery (1993b)* Gauge Capability Analysis and Designed Experiments: Part II: Experimental Design Models and Variance Component Estimation. Quality Engineering. p289-305
- *Borror, Montgomery, Runger (1997)* Confidence Intervals for Variance Components from Gauge Capability Studies. Qulity and Reliability Engineering International. p361-369
- *Burdick, Larsen (1997)* Confidence Intervals on Measures of Variability in Gauge R&R Studies. Journal of Quality Technology. p261-273
- *Burdick, Borror, Montgomery(2003)* A Review of Methods for Measurement Systems Capability Analysis. Journal of Quaity Technology. p342-354
- *Burdick, Borror, Montgomery(2005)* Design and Analysis of Gauge R&R Studies: Making Decisions with Confidence Intervals in Random and Mixed ANOVA Models, ASA-SIAM Series on Statistics and Applied Probability, SIAM, Philadelphia, PA, and ASA, Alexandria, VA. 